    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> alexcrichton created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14706#discussion_r4263023344\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Can these tests be rewritten to be independent of precise constants like this? This is quite brittle and will likely be annoying to change over time</p>\n</blockquote>",
