    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> alexcrichton created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14706#discussion_r4263001170\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>How required is this? This seems like a pretty brittle check to have anything in front of and this seems like it would be quite easy to get out of sync in the future. For example the 2 here seems to clearly relate to at least one <code>push</code> below, but the other one I'm not sure whether it's in <code>new_exlpcit</code> or <code>add_guest_thread_to_instance_table</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>",
