    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> alexcrichton created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14706#discussion_r4263028341\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This is a pretty huge test file for a pretty minor change -- are all of these tests necessary?</p>\n</blockquote>",
