        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> alexcrichton created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14706#discussion_r4263016433\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Instead of a loop here, could this be done with <code>self.entries.len() - self.live</code>? That in theory should give the number of free slots somewhere in the linked list.</p>\n</blockquote>",
