    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> macovedj created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14706#discussion_r4273297247\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If I'm not mistaken, <code>entries.len() - live</code> would count debug tombstones as free, since they’re excluded from live but aren’t available for reuse. I replaced the loop with <code>free_count</code>, which is updated when slots enter or leave the free list.  Please let me know if this doesn't feel any nicer or if you have other thoughts about a simpler approach.</p>\n</blockquote>",
