    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> macovedj created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14706#discussion_r4285509339\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I think the collapsed diff/naming makes it hard to follow. <code>entry</code> is the value that was just removed, so if a removed value is being replaced with a tombstone, it doesn't remain in the <code>live</code> count.  The negative case here should only happen when attempting to remove an <code>entry</code> that is already a tombstone.  I renamed to try and make this clearer.</p>\n</blockquote>",
